# License notice for this directory

`coldiff_v1_inference_official_fixed.py`, `coldiff_v2_inference_official_fixed.py` and
`coldiff_v2_inference_official_fixed_random.py` are modified copies of the inference script of
**ColorizeDiffusion** (https://github.com/tellurion-kanata/colorizeDiffusion, © the ColorizeDiffusion authors),
which is licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International**
license (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).

As derivative works they are distributed under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms and **not** under the MIT
license of the rest of this repository. Changes: deterministic region-based hint input instead of random
hint simulation, fixed-seed inference, and output paths for the Hint-AUC evaluation. They must be placed
inside the upstream code base and used with the upstream weights, which are not included here.

`run_coldiff_finetune_eval.sh` and `EXPERIMENT_coldiff_finetune.md` are our own launcher and notes (MIT).
